# .env.example — Osei K. Prempeh, P.A. website
#
# This is a STATIC, pre-rendered site. It needs NO secrets or API keys to run,
# build, or deploy. The consultation form sends directly to the firm's inbox via
# a `mailto:` link opened in the visitor's own mail client — there is no backend,
# no database, and no third-party form service to configure.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` only if you later adopt one of the OPTIONAL upgrades
# below. Nothing here is required for the current build.
#
# --- OPTIONAL: hosted form endpoint (future upgrade, see IMPLEMENTATION-INSTRUCTIONS.md §5) ---
# If you ever replace the mailto: handoff with guaranteed delivery (Formspree /
# Web3Forms / Netlify Forms), put the PUBLIC form id/endpoint here. It is public
# by design (embedded in the client) — it is NOT a secret.
# VITE_CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT="https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx"
#
# --- OPTIONAL: analytics (future, privacy-respecting) ---
# VITE_ANALYTICS_DOMAIN="oseiprempeh.com"
#
# NOTE: Do NOT add GEMINI_API_KEY, APP_URL, or any @google/genai / express config.
# Those came from the AI Studio export and are not used by this project.
